<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="set-bonuses">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_treasurechest02b.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Holy Paladins in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The Tier 14 set available in Phase One for Holy Paladins is not overly flashy nor exciting, but it remains nonetheless quite powerful. For raid healing <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=82327/holy-radiance">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_paladin_divinecircle.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Holy Radiance</span></a> is functionally a filler spell, and a 10% discount on mana cost is certainly welcome, particularly at the lower Spirit levels early in the expansion. Similarly, the 4-set allows more frequent casts of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=20473/holy-shock">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_searinglight.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Holy Shock</span></a> which is a core rotational spell that should be cast on cooldown for its Holy Power generation as well as <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=54149/infusion-of-light">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_paladin_infusionoflight.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Infusion of Light</span></a>. This proc makes the now cheaper Holy Radiance cast faster, which in turn gives the buff <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=88819/daybreak">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qirajidol_sun.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Daybreak</span></a>, empowering the more frequent casts of Holy Shock enabled; in this manner the 2-piece and 4-piece bonuses have strong recursive synergy.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-14">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Tier 14 - <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item-set=1134/white-tiger-vestments">
<span class="tinyicontxt">White Tiger Vestments</span></a></span></h3>
